      "content": "The problem is that we don't have time to \"assess his adaptability\" in the role. We need someone who is already wired for this. If he needs a defined process to function, he’s going to break the first time a major trade goes sideways or a project shifts overnight. Looking at his actual responses, he sounds like he'd be much happier at a steady, blue-chip firm than here. Be honest with me—if we hire him and he can't handle the volatility, that's on us. Is he actually a fit, or is he just a top-tier talent that’s in the wrong place?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
